		SYNTAX  DisplayString
		MAX-ACCESS  read-only
		STATUS  current
		DESCRIPTION
			"For port configured with OTU2 traffic, 
			An open connection indication is sent downstream when
			no signal is detected from upstream. It consists of a
			repeating 0b01100110 pattern in the entire ODUk signal,
			which excludes the Frame Alignment overhead and the
