        omtp12PlusLan10gFrameCheckSequenceAlarm OBJECT-TYPE
		SYNTAX  DisplayString
		MAX-ACCESS  read-only
		STATUS  current
		DESCRIPTION
		       "For port configured with 10G LAN traffic, 
			In the incoming ethernet frame, if the FCS value in the
			FCS byte and the FCS value calculated for the payload
			of the frame doesnt match, then number of FCS errors
			is incremented. If in one second 50 such FCS errors
			are got, then FCS this alarm will be generated. 
			-----------------------------
			omtp12PlusInterfaceNumber:
			1 - CLIENT-1
			-----------------------------
			Values :
			If Alarm is Present - Date and Time Stamp
